<title>USA: Platinum to buy some K-Tel music assets.</title>
<headline>Platinum to buy some K-Tel music assets.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH, Minn. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Platinum Entertainment Inc said Monday it has entered a definitive agreement to purchase certain music business assets from K-Tel International Inc for $35 million.</p>
</text>
